      <title>Over 270k Zimbabweans to benefit from new HIV drug</title>
      <link>https://www.thezimbabwean.co/2026/02/over-270k-zimbabweans-to-benefit-from-new-hiv-drug/</link>
      <description>The United States has launched lenacapavir (LEN), the new long-acting HIV prevention drug, in Zimbabwe, with plans to support 271,000 people over the next three years and prevent more than 9,000 new infections.</description>
