      <title>Prof Moyo backs electoral overhaul, dismisses referendum fears</title>
      <link>https://www.thezimbabwean.co/2026/02/prof-moyo-backs-electoral-overhaul-dismisses-referendum-fears/</link>
      <description>Professor Jonathan Moyo, a political scientist and former Cabinet minister, has broken ranks with the dominant tide of criticism surrounding the Constitution of Zimbabwe Amendment Bill (No. 3), 2026, arguing that the proposed changes are not an opportunistic power grab but a structural response to longstanding political distortions embedded in Zimbabwe’s constitutional history.</description>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.thezimbabwean.co/2026/02/prof-moyo-backs-electoral-overhaul-dismisses-referendum-fears/</guid>
