      <title>MoHCC targeting 1.4m children in Bilharzia fight</title>
      <link>https://www.thezimbabwean.co/2026/02/mohcc-targeting-1-4m-children-in-bilharzia-fight/</link>
      <description>The Ministry of Health and Child Care (MoHCC) has launched a nationwide Mass Drug Administration (MDA) programme targeting 1,477,966 children aged between five and 14 years in a renewed push to eliminate schistosomiasis, commonly known as bilharzia, as a public health concern in Zimbabwe.</description>
